The source dataset is licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Changes to the source data include consumer-day selection, synthetic attack
transformations, serialized reference-week/query-day inputs, labels, teacher
rationales, and model evaluation outputs. Cite both the original UCI dataset
and this derived release, and identify modifications when redistributing it.
